## 🔍 Core Wireshark Display Filters Applied
- **SYN Scans:** `tcp.flags.syn == 1 && tcp.flags.ack == 0`
- **HTTP Logins:** `http.request.method == "POST" || http contains "password"`
- **DNS Lookups:** `dns.flags.response == 0`
- **VoIP Signaling:** `sip || rtp`
- **Failed HTTP Responses:** `http.response.code >= 400`
